<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Michigan State Hospital Fin Auth.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Michigan State Hospital Fin Auth.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>John Nuveen &amp; Co said it priced $19.980 million of Michigan State Hospital Finance Authority, hospital revenue bonds, Series 199 6 with a top yield of 5.80 percent in 2028.</p>
</text>
